<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
<title>Sam's Sublime</title>
<style>
body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;display:flex;justify-content:center}
.phone{width:390px;background:white;min-height:100vh;padding:16px}
.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:#1a1a4a}
.btn-orange{width:100%;background:#ff6a00;color:white;border:none;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}
.card{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin-top:12px}
.addr{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;margin:6px 0}
.addr.active{border-color:#ff6a00;background:#fff7ed}
.pay-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.pay{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;font-weight:600}
.pay.active{border-color:#ff6a00;background:#fff7ed}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="phone">
<div class="header"><div class="logo">Sam's Sublime</div><div>FR | EN</div></div>
<h2>Importer un produit Pinduoduo</h2>
<input style="width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #ddd" value="https://mobile.yangkeduo.com/goods.html?ps=8lcmHw3QUL">
<button class="btn-orange" onclick="document.getElementById('calc').innerHTML='42 500 FBU + 6 375 FBU + 4 200 FBU = <b>53 075 FBU</b>';document.getElementById('prev').innerHTML='<b>Produit importé - 8lcmHw3QUL</b><br>10k+ ventes<br>✓ Traduit'">⬇ Importer le produit</button>
<div class="card"><b>📁 Adresses du transitaire</b><div class="addr active">SAM-BJM-GZ-15 Guangzhou</div><div class="addr">SAM-BJM-YW-15 Yiwu</div></div>
<div class="card"><b>🧮 Calculateur de prix</b><div id="calc">Clique Importer pour calculer</div></div>
<div class="card"><b>💳 Paiement</b><div class="pay-grid"><div class="pay active">🟢 Lumicash</div><div class="pay">🔴 Airtel Money</div><div class="pay">🟠 Orange Money</div><div class="pay">🟢 Vodacom M-Pesa</div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div id="prev">Aperçu produit - à importer</div></div>
<button class="btn-orange">🔒 Procéder au paiement</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>